          "key": "daily_goal_count",
          "type": "integer",
          "required": false,
          "note": "Hifz per-ayah rows cannot carry the scalar counters. These four live on a single sentinel row (surah_id=0, ayah_no=0) so a restore keeps the user's goal and streak; without them importSnapshot would reset both on every sync pass."
