          "attributes": [
            "user_id",
            "surah_id",
            "ayah_no"
          ],
          "note": "One row per ayah per user; the app resolves a single ayah's status with Query.equal on the triple. The scalar counters use the sentinel row surah_id=0, ayah_no=0, which this index also covers."
